      "cooked": "<p>Let’s reflect on the life of Mr Fixer before he becomes a zombie ghost.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-188-writers-room-engine-block-blues-4\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-188-writers-room-engine-block-blues-4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/2/2195fb0b2700b1df502aa120a68af896730a6609.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-188-writers-room-engine-block-blues-4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Episode #188 - Writers' Room: Engine Block Blues #4</a></h3>\n\n  <p>The life of a man who has touched the lives of many.  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:22:54 Adam and I are excited to finally work through this limited series! It's got a lot of creative folks on it, and it's fun for us to work with an ensemble creative...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/4/45fb9b8b1a7a6ddd4d960cfe18346fa4764e4924.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/45fb9b8b1a7a6ddd4d960cfe18346fa4764e4924\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/45fb9b8b1a7a6ddd4d960cfe18346fa4764e4924_2_322x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"9Z60L2WsJNknktZyzStIgfZFMUI\" width=\"322\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/45fb9b8b1a7a6ddd4d960cfe18346fa4764e4924_2_322x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/45fb9b8b1a7a6ddd4d960cfe18346fa4764e4924_2_483x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/45fb9b8b1a7a6ddd4d960cfe18346fa4764e4924_2_644x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/45fb9b8b1a7a6ddd4d960cfe18346fa4764e4924_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×2977 606 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
