      "cooked": "<p>Triangle board joke is top-tier comedy. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=10\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>“The Inexcusable Parse” sounds like a good book title, just sayin’.</p>\n<p>Ah, now we know how Robot Christopher was created.</p>\n<p>…Did they just invent Extremiverse Snoopy?</p>\n<p>This is why they have no friends. :V</p>",
