      "username": "The_Justifier",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-09-07T22:07:26.343Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It occurs to me that early Parse is literally a killer robot - she got her “code” from Cosmic Omnitron, and it made her try to solve the world’s problems in the most brutally efficient method possible, <em>just like Omnitron did</em>.  (There isn’t one hint about this version of the character in the card game, of course; anyone playing SOTM but not listening to The Letters page would assume that the SOTM-verse’s equivalent to The Punisher was obviously Ex-Patriette, but it turns out First Appearance Parse is way closer.)</p>\n<p>I would hope that later in her career, after she becomes Space Parse, she has a story where she runs into some Celestial Executioners and is like “There, but for the grace of…”</p>",
