      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/{size}/1919_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-09-12T17:57:50.476Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There is something quite delightfully ironic about the fact that Expatriette is closer to being the Sentinel Comics version of Hawkeye (former criminal with a supervillain mentor/parental figure who eventually turned good after encounters with heroes, trick ammunition), while early Parse is closer to being the Punisher (focused solve-crime-by-murders person with poor social skills).</p>",
