    {
      "id": 264709,
      "name": "",
      "username": "LonelyMan",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2025-12-26T14:02:28.245Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I really want a story about Mister Fixer, the character who most represents normal humanity at its absolute peak, fighting Citizen Dawn.</p>\n<p>I feel a good job was done crafting Nightmist and Harpy so they’re not out of place in Dark Watch.  Nightmist has magic that’s very costly to herself, and Harpy has magic that’s dangerous to everything around her and very hard to control.  If Nightmist had Setback’s ability to mitigate the downside of her powers more reliably, she’d be even stronger than she is, while if Harpy was as disciplined as Fixer, she’d be unstoppable.</p>\n<p>Aw, poor Sil <em>bonk</em></p>",
      "post_number": 11,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2025-12-26T14:57:59.177Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
